WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.000
Swipe a foreign-currency record right to edit it, then open Exchange Rate

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:17.800
Choose either direction. Here, enter 1 AUD = 110.510 JPY

3
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:28.800
Check the conversion and save. The original amount and currency stay unchanged

4
00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:46.800
In Reports, open Exchange Rate to select records that still need a rate

5
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:53.400
Save to update the total while keeping rates already entered

6
00:00:53.400 --> 00:01:24.500
Switch the primary currency to USD; those records now need USD rates

7
00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:56.033
Switch back to AUD to reuse the saved rates
